function renderC014Evidence(done){const labels=[['KAD RUJUKAN','MAKNA SIMBOL'],['KOD ◆ ▣ ● ★','PAPAN BIRU UTAMA'],['SAMPUL ARAHAN','DI BELAKANG PAPAN']];const answers=['menerangkan','membawa kepada','ditemui'];return `<h2>Sambungkan bukti kod.</h2><div class="connections">${labels.map(([a,b],i)=>`<div class="connection"><b>${a}</b><select data-c014-link="${i}" ${done?'disabled':''}><option value="">Pilih hubungan…</option><option ${state.links[i]===answers[i]?'selected':''}>${answers[i]}</option><option>tidak berkaitan</option></select><b>${b}</b></div>`).join('')}</div>${button(done?'Buat deduksi →':'Semak sambungan',done?'next':'c014-check','primary')}`}
function completeC014(){state.status='completed';state.stars=Math.max(1,5-Math.floor(state.hintsUsed/3));state.xpEarned=380+(state.hintsUsed===0?30:0);state.completedAt=new Date().toISOString();if(!record||state.xpEarned>record.xpEarned||(state.xpEarned===record.xpEarned&&state.stars>record.stars))record=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(state));state.scene=10;sound('case-complete');persist();render()}
function renderC014(){const s=state.scene,done=state.solved[s];let body;if(file)body=`<h2>Fail Kes · Misteri Kod Empat Simbol</h2>${thirdArcClues.C014.slice(0,state.cluesFound).map((c,i)=>`<div class="evidence"><small>PETUNJUK ${i+1}</small>${c}</div>`).join('')}${button('Kembali','closefile','primary')}`;else if(s===0)body=`<div class="eyebrow">KES 014 · FAIL KETIGA</div><h2>Misteri Kod Empat Simbol</h2><div class="letter"><p>Sampul arahan Jejak Rahsia tidak berada di tempat biasa. Empat simbol mungkin menunjukkan lokasi selamatnya.</p></div><div class="heritage-witness compact"><img src="assets/characters/xiao-feng.webp" alt="Potret Xiao Feng"><span><b>Xiao Feng</b>“Saya rasa simbol-simbol itu pernah saya nampak di tempat lain dalam bilik ini.”</span></div>${button('Mulakan siasatan →','next','primary')}`;else if(s>=1&&s<=5)body=c014SceneTask(c014Targets[s-1],s===5?'Cari urutan kod.':'Cari makna simbol.',s===5?'Cari nota empat simbol di atas meja.':'Pilih kad rujukan yang sepadan dengan simbol berikut: '+c014Symbols[s-1].symbol,done);else if(s===6)body=c014Decoder();else if(s===7)body=c014SceneTask('papan biru utama','Sahkan lokasi fizikal.','Cari Papan Biru Utama, kemudian periksa di belakangnya.',done);else if(s===8)body=renderC014Evidence(done);else if(s===9)body=`<h2>Apakah yang berlaku kepada sampul arahan?</h2><div class="choices vertical statement-options">${['Kumar mengambil sampul itu.','Sampul dibuang semasa bilik dikemas.','Sampul diletakkan di belakang papan biru utama, dan lokasinya direkodkan menggunakan kod empat simbol.'].map((o,i)=>`<button data-c014-theory="${i}" class="statement-option"><span class="option-label">${'ABC'[i]}</span><span class="option-text">${o}</span></button>`).join('')}</div>`;else if(s===10)body=`<div class="celebrate"><h2>KES 014 SELESAI</h2><p>Puan Suraya mengesahkan sampul itu dipindahkan untuk disimpan dengan selamat ketika meja disusun semula. Petunjuk kodnya betul; legendanya sahaja telah terpisah.</p>${button('Lihat keputusan →','next','primary')}</div>`;else body=`<div class="celebrate result-screen"><div class="tag">KES 014 SELESAI</div><h2>Misteri Kod Empat Simbol</h2><div class="stars">${'★'.repeat(state.stars)}${'☆'.repeat(5-state.stars)}</div><div class="stats"><div><b>5/5</b><span>Petunjuk</span></div><div><b>+${state.xpEarned}</b><span>XP diperoleh</span></div><div><b>${(record||state).xpEarned||0}</b><span>XP terbaik</span></div></div><section class="milestone"><h3>✦ PEMBACA KOD</h3><p>Kamu mentafsir empat simbol dan menemui sampul arahan.</p></section><div class="actions">${button('Lihat Fail Kes','file','primary')}${button('Kembali ke agensi','home')}${button('Main semula','replay')}</div></div>`;app.innerHTML=`<main><div class="topline">${button('← Agensi','home')}<span class="tag">KES 014 · ${state.cluesFound}/5 PETUNJUK</span>${button('▤ Fail Kes','file')}</div><div class="layout"><section class="panel">${body}${feedback?`<div role="status" class="feedback ${wrong?'wrong':''}">${feedback}</div>`:''}</section><aside class="klu">${companionArt(state.status==='completed'||s>=10?'celebrate':wrong?'thinking':s===6&&state.code.hints?'hint':done?'excited':'neutral')}<div class="klu-message"><div class="eyebrow">KLU · RAKAN DETEKTIF</div><p>${s===6?'Gunakan makna yang ditemui dan baca simbol dari kiri ke kanan.':s===7?'Kod itu perlu membawa kita kepada tempat sebenar.':'Cari bukti visual sebelum membuat kesimpulan.'}</p></div></aside>${caseShelf()}</div></main>`}
function handleC014Click(b){if(b.dataset.symbolHint!==undefined){c014Hint();return}if(b.dataset.symbolAnswer!==undefined){state.attempts++;if(Number(b.dataset.symbolAnswer)===0&&state.cluesFound===5){state.code.decoded=true;state.solved[6]=true;state.code.feedback='✓ Kod itu bermaksud DI BELAKANG PAPAN BIRU UTAMA.';wrong=false;sound('correct');persist();render()}else{state.code.feedback='Tafsiran itu belum tepat. Semak empat makna simbol.';wrong=true;sound('wrong-soft');persist();render()}return}if(b.dataset.object){state.attempts++;const target=state.scene<=5?c014Targets[state.scene-1]:state.scene===7?'papan biru utama':'';if(b.dataset.object===target){if(!state.sceneProgress.communityPrep.includes(target))state.sceneProgress.communityPrep.push(target);if(state.scene<=5)completeC014Clue();else{state.solved[7]=true;feedback='✓ Sampul arahan ditemui di belakang Papan Biru Utama.';wrong=false;sound('clue-found');persist();render()}}else fail('Objek itu belum melengkapkan langkah ini. Cuba lagi.');return}if(b.dataset.c014Theory!==undefined){state.attempts++;if(b.dataset.c014Theory==='2'&&state.solved[8])completeC014();else fail('Teori itu belum menerangkan kod dan lokasi sampul. Cuba lagi.');return}switch(b.dataset.action){case'start':home=false;render();break;case'home':home=true;file=false;persist();render();break;case'file':file=true;render();break;case'closefile':file=false;render();break;case'next':if(safeNeedsSolve(state.scene)&&!state.solved[state.scene]||state.scene===6&&!state.code.decoded||state.scene===7&&!state.solved[7]||state.scene===8&&!state.solved[8])return;state.scene++;feedback='';wrong=false;persist();render();break;case'c014-check':state.attempts++;if(state.links.join('|')==='menerangkan|membawa kepada|ditemui'){state.solved[8]=true;feedback='✓ Bukti kod disambungkan dengan tepat.';wrong=false;sound('board-complete');persist();render()}else fail('Sambungan belum lengkap. Semak makna kod dan tempat sampul.');break;case'replay':state=fresh14();record=cases.C014.record||record;home=false;file=false;feedback='';wrong=false;persist();render();break}}

